WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.760 --> 03:10.280
Have you heard anything from Mom?

3
03:11.040 --> 03:13.880
Don't talk about her anymore. We all have to bear our own choices.

4
03:13.960 --> 03:16.600
If you run from me, I'll kill you.

5
03:16.680 --> 03:18.000
If you still love me,

6
03:19.120 --> 03:21.680
then go live your own life.

7
03:21.760 --> 03:23.400
Goodbye, Mom.

8
03:24.400 --> 03:26.880
Mom, where are you?

9
03:26.960 --> 03:28.560
Grandma and I will come get you.

10
03:28.640 --> 03:30.920
-Don't! Mom! -Grandma!

11
03:31.000 --> 03:32.720
-Grandma! -Mom!

12
03:33.960 --> 03:35.680
Grandma!

13
03:35.760 --> 03:38.920
PREVIOUSLY

14
04:06.720 --> 04:09.560
You probably feel like your whole world

15
04:10.600 --> 04:11.520
has collapsed.

16
04:14.520 --> 04:16.959
It was like that for me

17
04:18.880 --> 04:20.680
when my father left me

18
04:22.520 --> 04:24.480
and my mother started a new family.

19
04:26.640 --> 04:28.680
I felt

20
04:29.840 --> 04:33.080
completely alone, like I had nothing left.

21
04:36.440 --> 04:38.760
But I chose to keep living.

22
04:39.960 --> 04:41.560
I wondered

23
04:42.760 --> 04:44.840
if maybe I just loved myself too much.

24
04:46.400 --> 04:47.960
But that wasn't it.

25
04:51.840 --> 04:53.240
The truth is, I loved my mom.

26
04:55.560 --> 04:57.080
I wanted her to be happy.

27
04:59.200 --> 05:00.920
I wanted to be able to take care of her.

28
05:03.600 --> 05:06.200
None of us is born into this world completely alone.

29
05:09.000 --> 05:10.440
We still have family.

30
05:11.760 --> 05:14.960
And I chose to keep living

31
05:16.280 --> 05:17.400
for the people I love.

32
05:21.960 --> 05:23.880
I don't know how you feel about it.

33
05:25.320 --> 05:26.680
But I want you to know that

34
05:30.040 --> 05:31.200
I'll always be here for you.

35
06:42.160 --> 06:43.360
Hathaya.

36
06:44.760 --> 06:47.200
Death isn't something we should only grieve.

37
06:48.160 --> 06:50.000
In a way, it can also be something to celebrate.

38
06:53.000 --> 06:55.840
Duangjai lived a long life.

39
06:56.360 --> 06:59.560
She experienced plenty of sorrow and happiness.

40
07:00.960 --> 07:02.960
And the love you gave her

41
07:03.040 --> 07:05.840
allowed her spirit to leave this world in peace.

42
07:08.280 --> 07:10.040
I'm speaking as an old man now.

43
07:13.160 --> 07:17.040
All grandparents want is to see their kids and grandkids happy and successful.

44
07:19.160 --> 07:22.640
That's all we truly want.

45
07:25.000 --> 07:29.200
I want Grandma to be at peace.

46
07:30.880 --> 07:32.640
I won't fall apart anymore.

47
07:35.360 --> 07:38.320
Take her urn upstairs to the prayer room.

48
07:41.320 --> 07:43.800
Duangjai was practically family to me.

49
07:46.000 --> 07:47.680
Place her beside your father.

50
07:54.520 --> 07:56.400
-Let's go. -Yes, sir.

51
08:54.200 --> 08:55.640
Dad,

52
08:57.720 --> 09:00.240
please take care of Grandma for me.

53
09:09.920 --> 09:12.760
Dad, Grandma, please keep giving me strength.

54
09:13.800 --> 09:17.480
I promise I'll be strong.

55
09:24.040 --> 09:26.280
I'll make both of you

56
09:27.120 --> 09:28.920
proud of me.

57
09:56.520 --> 09:57.640
Don't go in there.

58
10:00.960 --> 10:02.440
That isn't your room.

59
10:03.480 --> 10:05.400
I threw all your things away.

60
10:08.440 --> 10:12.680
And don't come upstairs again. You're a maid, so stay where you belong.

61
10:28.280 --> 10:30.800
I'm not completely heartless,

62
10:31.840 --> 10:33.960
but she still has more to prove.

63
10:41.480 --> 10:44.640
Madam. Madam. Madam.

64
10:44.720 --> 10:47.200
Would you stop bothering me? Go do whatever you have to.

65
10:47.280 --> 10:49.960
If you have nothing to do,

66
10:50.040 --> 10:52.520
go find a cat or dog to bathe. Go.

67
10:52.600 --> 10:56.000
Madam, please listen to me first.

68
10:56.080 --> 10:57.640
She's here.

69
10:57.720 --> 10:59.280
Who?

70
10:59.360 --> 11:03.320
Hathai. Hathaya's mother. She's already come into the house.

71
11:03.400 --> 11:06.480
What? Hathai? Where is she?

72
11:06.560 --> 11:08.280
Out front. Let's go.

73
11:09.760 --> 11:12.680
If you don't stay here, where will you go?

74
11:13.600 --> 11:16.760
I'll take her somewhere myself.

75
11:16.840 --> 11:19.360
Somewhere more appropriate for her.

76
11:20.200 --> 11:21.080
Liu.

77
11:21.160 --> 11:22.880
-Chamoi. -Yes?

78
11:22.960 --> 11:25.320
Take Hathai's bag.

79
11:25.400 --> 11:26.720
Yes, madam.

80
11:28.680 --> 11:30.880
Chamoi, where are you taking my bag?

81
11:30.960 --> 11:31.800
Chamoi.

82
11:31.880 --> 11:33.760
Somewhere you belong.

83
11:35.080 --> 11:36.720
Throw it out.

84
11:36.800 --> 11:37.920
That's my bag.

85
11:38.000 --> 11:39.360
Chamoi.

86
11:40.920 --> 11:43.680
Outside this house is where you belong. Get out.

87
11:44.280 --> 11:46.000
Ann, give that back right now.

88
11:46.080 --> 11:47.520
It belongs to Ms. Hathai.

89
11:47.600 --> 11:51.720
Liu. I know I treated you badly.

90
11:53.440 --> 11:54.840
I want to apologize.

91
11:56.080 --> 11:59.080
You think an apology makes everything go away?

92
11:59.600 --> 12:03.080
You stole what was mine. You caused my husband's death.

93
12:03.160 --> 12:05.440
Is being sorry enough to make up for all that?

94
12:05.520 --> 12:09.360
Then what do you want me to do before you'll stop being angry with me?

95
12:10.000 --> 12:11.760
Kneel and bow to me.

96
12:11.840 --> 12:13.280
Right now.

97
12:18.240 --> 12:20.760
Mom, you don't have to.

98
12:20.840 --> 12:22.240
Stay out of this, Hathaya.

99
12:22.320 --> 12:24.400
I don't mean to hold this over your head,

100
12:24.480 --> 12:26.880
but I've done enough to protect you and Chayanee

101
12:26.960 --> 12:29.240
that you should be able to forgive us.

102
12:31.840 --> 12:32.920
-I'm sorry. -Mom.

103
12:36.320 --> 12:40.000
Let me do this. You've done enough for me.

104
12:40.680 --> 12:42.400
Let me do something for myself for once.

105
13:26.480 --> 13:27.960
I'm sorry.

106
13:30.160 --> 13:32.080
And I hope everything

107
13:33.240 --> 13:34.720
can end here.

108
13:40.000 --> 13:42.040
Come on, Mom.

109
13:45.200 --> 13:46.920
You really have no shame.

110
13:48.680 --> 13:50.000
No conscience.

111
13:51.080 --> 13:54.960
No remorse. You're the reason your own mother died.

112
13:57.280 --> 14:01.120
Hathaya loved her grandmother more than anything. She did everything for her.

113
14:01.200 --> 14:03.120
But you were the reason

114
14:03.200 --> 14:04.880
Hathaya's grandmother died.

115
14:04.960 --> 14:08.120
You've been ruining Hathaya's life

116
14:08.200 --> 14:10.720
ever since you took her away from this house.

117
14:12.280 --> 14:15.440
If I were you,

118
14:15.520 --> 14:17.440
I wouldn't have the nerve to show my face here

119
14:18.520 --> 14:21.600
or beg my daughter for sympathy again.

120
14:25.480 --> 14:28.600
Mom, come see Grandpa. Come on.

121
14:40.560 --> 14:42.520
I don't want to be a burden to you anymore.

122
14:43.120 --> 14:46.520
Mom, don't listen to what other people say.

123
14:48.600 --> 14:50.400
But Liu is right.

124
14:56.960 --> 14:59.360
I took you away from this house

125
15:01.280 --> 15:04.120
and made you lose so many good opportunities in life.

126
15:07.160 --> 15:09.040
I did terrible things.

127
15:12.400 --> 15:14.640
And I was the reason Grandma died.

128
15:17.520 --> 15:19.280
Just let me go my own way.

129
15:21.040 --> 15:22.760
Mom.

130
15:24.440 --> 15:28.120
If you love me, then stay with me.

131
15:29.320 --> 15:33.360
Whatever happens, you have to accept it and fight through it.

132
15:35.840 --> 15:37.720
I know you feel guilty.

133
15:39.120 --> 15:43.120
Then prove yourself. Show everyone

134
15:43.200 --> 15:45.000
that you can make things right.

135
15:45.080 --> 15:47.080
Show them that you can change.

136
15:50.440 --> 15:51.600
Mom.

137
15:54.480 --> 15:56.960
I'm not as strong.

138
15:59.080 --> 16:01.640
I need someone beside me too.

139
16:04.880 --> 16:06.520
Will you stay with me?

140
16:17.520 --> 16:18.720
Alright.

141
16:20.960 --> 16:22.320
I'll stay with you.

142
16:24.760 --> 16:26.440
I'll protect you.

143
16:50.600 --> 16:54.280
Mom, I'll take you to see Grandpa.

144
17:51.440 --> 17:53.800
What you did caused me tremendous pain.

145
17:56.200 --> 17:58.280
I lost both of my sons.

146
18:00.640 --> 18:03.760
Even if you lay down and died in front of me today,

147
18:05.040 --> 18:07.760
it still wouldn't make up for what you did.

148
18:09.640 --> 18:12.560
I accept responsibility for everything, Father.

149
18:13.680 --> 18:15.440
Don't call me Father.

150
18:17.880 --> 18:19.880
Whatever relationship we had ended

151
18:19.960 --> 18:22.440
the day you took your daughter and left this house.

152
18:31.080 --> 18:34.600
If you won't forgive me, then I'll leave.

153
18:36.560 --> 18:39.080
Stop wandering around and causing trouble for your daughter.

154
18:45.280 --> 18:47.840
I'll allow you to stay in this house.

155
18:50.360 --> 18:52.320
But only because you are Hathaya's mother.

156
19:00.520 --> 19:01.840
Thank you, Father.

157
19:04.160 --> 19:07.440
All I ask is to be allowed to take care of my daughter.

158
19:11.080 --> 19:13.160
But I won't give up either.

159
19:14.400 --> 19:17.280
I'll wait for the day you can forgive me.

160
19:46.360 --> 19:47.600
I hate them.

161
19:48.480 --> 19:50.960
I won't let them live happily here.

162
20:05.160 --> 20:08.800
Listen, everyone. My son Raiwin is candidate number one.

163
20:09.360 --> 20:10.400
Please support him.

164
20:10.480 --> 20:13.760
People of my generation have had our time. Now it's time to step aside and let

165
20:13.840 --> 20:16.120
the younger generation come in and manage our community

166
20:16.200 --> 20:18.520
so it can continue to grow and prosper.

167
20:19.080 --> 20:19.960
For Raiwin,

168
20:20.040 --> 20:22.920
I am ready to give him my full backing and support for him

169
20:23.000 --> 20:25.120
as a new-generation leader

170
20:25.200 --> 20:28.240
who will continue developing our community.

171
20:28.920 --> 20:32.680
Some reports say Mr. Saksit put you forward as his proxy.

172
20:32.760 --> 20:33.640
Is that true?

173
20:34.400 --> 20:36.600
My father gives me complete freedom

174
20:36.680 --> 20:38.600
when it comes to my policies and ideas.

175
20:39.560 --> 20:42.760
I want everyone to trust that I genuinely intend

176
20:42.840 --> 20:44.680
to improve lives in this community.

177
20:45.240 --> 20:48.880
I want everyone to live better and have enough to support themselves.

178
20:48.960 --> 20:52.240
And I will make this Subdistrict Office free of corruption.

179
20:52.800 --> 20:54.320
Vote number one.

180
20:54.400 --> 20:58.000
Congratulations to candidate number one.

181
20:58.960 --> 21:00.080
Thank you.

182
21:00.160 --> 21:02.600
Is Miss Chayanee, Mr. Pichai's granddaughter,

183
21:02.680 --> 21:05.280
also one of your major supporters?

184
21:05.360 --> 21:06.960
-Chayanee-- -Yes.

185
21:09.560 --> 21:11.320
I'm Raiwin's girlfriend,

186
21:11.400 --> 21:13.680
and I'm ready to support him in everything.

187
21:14.280 --> 21:17.800
The two of us will work hand in hand to make this a better community.

188
21:17.880 --> 21:19.520
Please support us.

189
21:19.600 --> 21:21.400
Raiwin, number one.

190
21:21.480 --> 21:23.680
Please support us.

191
21:23.760 --> 21:25.680
Remember number one. He's my son.

192
21:25.760 --> 21:28.760
If there's ever anything I can do for you, just let me know.

193
21:28.840 --> 21:32.160
Number one. Okay?

194
21:36.120 --> 21:37.840
I'm taking you for a luck ritual.

195
21:37.920 --> 21:41.680
I know a shrine that never fails. Everyone who goes there succeeds.

196
21:43.360 --> 21:48.000
I think success is more about good policies and getting out to meet people.

197
21:48.080 --> 21:50.440
We need to earn their trust.

198
21:50.520 --> 21:53.080
But spiritual rituals matter too.

199
21:53.160 --> 21:56.360
Don't disrespect what you don't believe in. I already set your schedule.

200
21:56.440 --> 21:57.680
I got my candidate number.

201
21:57.760 --> 22:00.280
I need to meet voters. I have no time for that.

202
22:00.360 --> 22:03.000
If you want to do the rituals, you can do them for me.

203
22:03.880 --> 22:06.880
What is wrong with you? You oppose everything I say.

204
22:07.600 --> 22:10.240
I'm not trying to oppose with you. I just don't agree.

205
22:10.840 --> 22:14.320
And I also wasn't happy about you stealing the spotlight during the interview.

206
22:16.960 --> 22:18.240
You're angry with me?

207
22:21.640 --> 22:25.360
I'm not angry.

208
22:26.080 --> 22:28.480
But I wasn't okay with it. Instead

209
22:28.560 --> 22:31.000
of giving me room to promote myself,

210
22:31.520 --> 22:34.760
you took over and answered everything for me.

211
22:35.360 --> 22:38.120
Chayanee.

212
22:38.200 --> 22:41.800
You came all this way to congratulate Raiwin.

213
22:41.880 --> 22:42.760
Why don't we all

214
22:42.840 --> 22:45.880
go get something good to eat?

215
22:45.960 --> 22:48.680
We can celebrate in advance.

216
22:48.760 --> 22:50.000
I'm not going.

217
22:51.520 --> 22:54.480
What happened?

218
22:54.560 --> 22:58.600
Ask your son. He says I stole the spotlight from him

219
22:58.680 --> 23:01.040
when I was only trying to help build his support base.

220
23:01.120 --> 23:03.520
People today need to work as a team.

221
23:05.680 --> 23:06.800
And don't forget.

222
23:07.320 --> 23:09.600
Every baht you're spending

223
23:09.680 --> 23:13.520
on registering and campaigning is my money.

224
23:15.440 --> 23:19.280
If you think I'm embarrassing you,

225
23:19.360 --> 23:20.920
then maybe I won't get involved.

226
23:23.800 --> 23:27.320
Why don't we all calm down and talk about this?

227
23:27.400 --> 23:29.120
And you too, Uncle.

228
23:29.840 --> 23:33.440
All the customers you sent us last time couldn't get financing.

229
23:34.400 --> 23:37.680
Next time, please send higher-class customers.

230
23:37.760 --> 23:39.320
I don't want low-end customers.

231
23:49.880 --> 23:51.200
She's so spoiled.

232
23:52.400 --> 23:53.400
Hey.

233
23:54.000 --> 23:57.840
Raiwin, go after Chayanee and apologize right now.

234
23:57.920 --> 23:59.240
Dad.

235
23:59.840 --> 24:02.720
She just insulted you. And you still want me to go apologize to her?

236
24:02.800 --> 24:06.680
Every election costs money.

237
24:06.760 --> 24:09.080
It isn't won with your ridiculous fantasy policies.

238
24:10.200 --> 24:12.520
I told you. I'm not selling fantasies.

239
24:12.600 --> 24:15.160
I'm offering ideas for improving the community.

240
24:17.080 --> 24:20.760
I've been a politician my entire life.

241
24:20.840 --> 24:23.480
I know what voters like and what they don't.

242
24:23.560 --> 24:26.280
They won't even read those ridiculous policies of yours.

243
24:26.880 --> 24:28.520
They vote for the person with money.

244
24:28.600 --> 24:31.400
That's real life, son.

245
24:35.720 --> 24:38.400
If you don't have campaign money,

246
24:38.480 --> 24:39.880
you've already lost.

247
24:41.000 --> 24:42.200
Go on.

248
24:42.280 --> 24:45.400
Go apologize to Chayanee right now. Go.

249
24:45.480 --> 24:48.880
I said go. Now.

250
24:58.240 --> 24:59.200
I'm sorry.

251
25:00.160 --> 25:03.680
Nothing I do is ever good enough. Don't waste your time on me.

252
25:04.680 --> 25:05.800
Chayanee.

253
25:10.080 --> 25:12.920
I'm sorry. I love you.

254
25:14.760 --> 25:16.760
I love you too.

255
25:21.040 --> 25:23.720
Everything I do is for you.

256
25:25.080 --> 25:27.880
Promise me you won't hurt me again.

257
25:31.200 --> 25:35.000
Say it. Promise me you won't go against me again.

258
25:39.440 --> 25:40.360
I promise.

259
25:43.440 --> 25:45.640
I love my future Chief more than anything.

260
25:48.400 --> 25:49.480
Let's go.

261
26:13.440 --> 26:16.360
Madam, are you really going to let Hathai

262
26:16.440 --> 26:18.440
stay here and walk all over you?

263
26:18.520 --> 26:21.800
Just think about it. Mr. Pichai already trusts Hathaya,

264
26:21.880 --> 26:25.320
and now her mother has moved in too. They'll be twice as manipulative.

265
26:25.400 --> 26:28.080
What if Mr. Pichai leaves his inheritance to them?

266
26:30.000 --> 26:33.520
Shut up. I've already been thinking about it so much

267
26:33.600 --> 26:35.800
I'm getting a migraine.

268
26:35.880 --> 26:37.440
Madam.

269
26:37.520 --> 26:39.640
I'm only worried about you.

270
26:39.720 --> 26:43.520
I'm getting a migraine too. My head is throbbing.

271
26:43.600 --> 26:47.120
At least Father still hasn't forgiven Hathai.

272
26:47.200 --> 26:48.760
But we can't let our guard down.

273
26:48.840 --> 26:52.400
Those people are like venomous snakes waiting to strike.

274
26:53.520 --> 26:57.360
Then we have to get rid of them and send them far away.

275
26:57.440 --> 26:59.360
You think they're bags of garbage

276
26:59.440 --> 27:01.960
we can just throw out?

277
27:02.960 --> 27:05.560
Then we have to pressure them.

278
27:05.640 --> 27:07.960
Make things unbearable for them.

279
27:09.360 --> 27:12.280
Then we make

280
27:12.360 --> 27:14.240
Father think they're bad people.

281
27:16.200 --> 27:17.640
How are you going to do that?

282
27:30.840 --> 27:33.720
Brilliant. Absolutely brilliant.

283
27:33.800 --> 27:35.600
That idea is downright evil.

284
27:38.280 --> 27:40.200
-That was a compliment, right? -Absolutely.

285
27:47.880 --> 27:48.920
What are you making?

286
27:50.080 --> 27:51.800
Rice porridge for Grandpa.

287
27:52.440 --> 27:53.520
Want me to help?

288
27:57.240 --> 28:00.400
Actually, maybe I shouldn't.

289
28:00.480 --> 28:02.640
If Grandpa finds out, he might get angry again.

290
28:05.840 --> 28:07.000
Come on, Mom.

291
28:07.880 --> 28:11.520
Help me. Your cooking is better than mine.

292
28:11.600 --> 28:12.920
Then let's do it.

293
28:13.600 --> 28:15.040
Ms. Hathai

294
28:15.600 --> 28:19.560
used to cook almost every meal herself.

295
28:19.640 --> 28:23.200
I still miss your cooking.

296
28:23.960 --> 28:27.240
Thanks, Ann. You're always encouraging me.

297
28:30.400 --> 28:31.920
Let's do it together, Mom.

298
28:32.000 --> 28:34.400
You make the porridge, and I'll prepare the seasonings.

299
28:38.280 --> 28:39.560
You're sure to make it delicious.

300
28:45.040 --> 28:48.560
Madam. I got it.

301
28:48.640 --> 28:49.640
The good stuff.

302
28:54.360 --> 28:56.440
You're a genius, madam.

303
28:56.520 --> 29:00.000
If we put this in Hathaya and her mother's food every day,

304
29:00.080 --> 29:02.280
they'll run out of this house before long.

305
29:03.320 --> 29:05.000
Think, Chamoi.

306
29:05.840 --> 29:08.120
How many days would we have to keep giving it to them

307
29:08.200 --> 29:09.280
before they finally gave up?

308
29:11.400 --> 29:13.840
Well, probably a while.

309
29:13.920 --> 29:16.040
But I only need to use it once

310
29:16.760 --> 29:19.920
to get them thrown out of this house.

311
29:20.520 --> 29:21.480
How?

312
29:21.560 --> 29:25.160
We put it in the food they made for Father.

313
29:26.560 --> 29:29.080
Madam. Then Mr. Pichai will--

314
29:30.200 --> 29:33.120
He'll just have to use the bathroom a few times. It won't kill him.

315
29:33.760 --> 29:36.600
I already prepared an electrolyte solution for him.

316
29:37.240 --> 29:38.640
Here. Take care of it.

317
29:38.720 --> 29:40.200
Yes, madam.

318
29:40.280 --> 29:42.080
Go.

319
29:47.600 --> 29:48.720
Aunt Liu, is something wrong?

320
29:48.800 --> 29:50.560
If you came for the food,

321
29:50.640 --> 29:53.160
Mom and I just finished. We were about to take it to Grandpa.

322
29:54.320 --> 29:55.520
I know

323
29:55.600 --> 29:58.520
you two cook so well

324
29:59.320 --> 30:02.840
that Father loves everything you make. Everything you do pleases him.

325
30:03.440 --> 30:06.000
What do you want? Just say it.

326
30:11.280 --> 30:14.720
Father barely speaks to me anymore.

327
30:16.080 --> 30:18.000
I just want to help with something.

328
30:18.760 --> 30:21.240
Here. Give it to me. I'll help carry it to Father.

329
30:21.320 --> 30:23.720
Don't. They can't be trusted.

330
30:23.800 --> 30:24.800
What's that?

331
30:24.880 --> 30:27.280
She said you two look suspicious.

332
30:29.680 --> 30:31.280
But I don't think so.

333
30:32.120 --> 30:36.000
I know you love and care about Father just as much as we do.

334
30:42.680 --> 30:44.080
Let's take it to Grandpa.

335
30:57.680 --> 30:58.960
Hurry.

336
30:59.040 --> 31:01.200
-It'll give him the runs. -Quickly.

337
31:02.000 --> 31:02.960
More.

338
31:03.040 --> 31:05.760
This is already enough to send someone running to the bathroom.

339
31:06.360 --> 31:09.880
Make sure it works. I want Father to be furious with them.

340
31:09.960 --> 31:12.520
-Pour in more. -The whole bottle?

341
31:17.600 --> 31:19.280
Is something wrong?

342
31:19.360 --> 31:20.520
Why aren't you coming?

343
31:21.240 --> 31:22.720
You're so slow.

344
31:22.800 --> 31:24.320
Hurry up. Father must be hungry.

345
31:24.400 --> 31:26.200
Yes.

346
31:32.080 --> 31:33.320
Oh!

347
31:35.840 --> 31:37.160
What is it?

348
31:37.920 --> 31:39.680
Aunt Liu, come sit and eat with us.

349
31:41.320 --> 31:42.480
Father.

350
31:42.560 --> 31:44.600
Why don't you eat this bowl instead?

351
31:44.680 --> 31:46.640
Hathai and Hathaya

352
31:46.720 --> 31:49.120
made it especially for you.

353
31:50.000 --> 31:53.280
But that bowl

354
31:53.360 --> 31:55.120
came from the same pot Mom and I made.

355
31:55.200 --> 31:59.040
I brought Grandpa his bowl first so he could take his medicine on time.

356
31:59.120 --> 32:00.200
Oh.

357
32:00.720 --> 32:03.080
Father probably isn't full yet.

358
32:03.160 --> 32:06.520
Have another bowl. Then you can take your medicine.

359
32:06.600 --> 32:08.920
I'm full. I'm taking my medicine now.

360
32:12.000 --> 32:14.440
What a shame. There's still another bowl left.

361
32:16.760 --> 32:17.880
Then eat it yourself.

362
32:25.320 --> 32:26.200
What?

363
32:28.160 --> 32:33.040
It's okay, Father. I'm already full.

364
32:33.120 --> 32:36.400
I'll give this bowl to Chamoi.

365
32:36.480 --> 32:38.080
Eat it.

366
32:38.160 --> 32:40.360
I'm full too, sir.

367
32:40.440 --> 32:43.480
I was tasting the food while we made it. I'm completely stuffed.

368
32:44.080 --> 32:46.920
Why make such a big deal about eating together?

369
32:47.000 --> 32:48.600
Just take it away.

370
32:48.680 --> 32:50.880
Aunt Liu.

371
32:51.760 --> 32:53.120
Are you still angry with Mom?

372
32:55.120 --> 32:58.520
Mom put a lot of effort into making this porridge.

373
32:58.600 --> 33:00.040
Come eat with us.

374
33:02.760 --> 33:04.520
I'm really not hungry.

375
33:05.120 --> 33:07.680
Stop standing over everyone. Sit down and eat.

376
33:09.600 --> 33:12.440
Are you going to refuse Grandpa?

377
33:16.520 --> 33:18.920
Please sit.

378
33:42.560 --> 33:45.200
Such a tiny bite.

379
33:45.280 --> 33:47.760
That's not very respectful, Liu.

380
33:54.040 --> 33:55.480
Yes.

381
33:58.560 --> 34:01.640
Madam, take a big bite.

382
34:01.720 --> 34:03.400
Show some spirit.

383
34:20.239 --> 34:22.000
Delicious.

384
34:23.199 --> 34:25.280
If it's delicious, finish the whole bowl.

385
34:27.800 --> 34:29.719
Have plenty.

386
34:38.440 --> 34:39.920
Delicious.

387
34:41.560 --> 34:46.040
Aunt Liu, why do you look so nauseated?

388
34:46.120 --> 34:49.239
You're acting like there's poison in that porridge.

389
34:49.320 --> 34:52.320
What poison? There's nothing in it.

390
34:52.400 --> 34:55.560
It's just rice porridge. Delicious.

391
34:57.480 --> 34:59.640
Then eat plenty.

392
34:59.720 --> 35:01.120
Finish the bowl.

393
35:17.080 --> 35:18.040
What's wrong?

394
35:18.640 --> 35:20.160
Nothing.

395
35:31.800 --> 35:32.920
Actually, something's wrong.

396
35:34.280 --> 35:35.400
Excuse me.

397
35:41.520 --> 35:45.360
Sir, may I go check on Madam?

398
35:46.880 --> 35:48.760
What is wrong with Liu today?

399
35:49.400 --> 35:51.640
Getting up and leaving like that. So rude.

400
35:51.720 --> 35:54.080
She may not be feeling well, Grandpa.

401
35:54.160 --> 35:57.880
If you're finished eating, you should rest. I'll take care of everything here.

402
36:16.120 --> 36:17.520
Come on, sweetheart. Keep eating.

403
36:21.080 --> 36:22.560
Madam.

404
36:25.040 --> 36:28.480
Are you okay?

405
36:30.160 --> 36:32.720
I only ate a few bites.

406
36:32.800 --> 36:34.160
How could it be this bad?

407
36:35.360 --> 36:39.040
That means the medicine really works.

408
36:39.120 --> 36:41.640
What a great product. I should go leave them a review.

409
36:41.720 --> 36:42.920
You idiot.

410
36:44.520 --> 36:47.880
Madam? Are you okay?

411
36:48.480 --> 36:49.600
I don't…

412
36:51.160 --> 36:52.400
think I…

413
37:01.640 --> 37:03.920
I can't breathe, madam.

414
37:04.560 --> 37:05.760
I… can't--

415
37:12.960 --> 37:15.000
Sit down, madam.

416
37:16.720 --> 37:20.480
-Are you okay? -There's nothing left inside me.

417
37:20.560 --> 37:22.200
I don't even have the strength

418
37:22.280 --> 37:24.160
to breathe.

419
37:24.240 --> 37:26.160
Madam.

420
37:26.240 --> 37:28.160
You have to breathe.

421
37:28.240 --> 37:30.480
If you stop breathing, you'll die.

422
37:31.880 --> 37:34.880
Help me. I have no strength left.

423
37:34.960 --> 37:37.480
Come on.

424
37:37.560 --> 37:38.800
-I can't-- -Aunt Liu,

425
37:39.360 --> 37:40.800
here's some electrolyte solution

426
37:42.240 --> 37:44.400
for the diarrhea. Sip it slowly.

427
37:44.480 --> 37:45.880
It helps replace lost fluids.

428
37:46.760 --> 37:49.880
You knew?

429
37:51.320 --> 37:54.160
Yes. I knew what you were planning.

430
37:54.720 --> 37:58.120
We put this medicine into the food they made for Father.

431
37:58.200 --> 37:59.240
Yes.

432
37:59.760 --> 38:01.840
Go.

433
38:08.600 --> 38:10.400
You knew what I was doing?

434
38:10.480 --> 38:11.720
Then why didn't you stop me?

435
38:12.720 --> 38:16.600
If we had stopped you, you wouldn't have learned your lesson.

436
38:17.200 --> 38:19.320
The moral of this story is simple.

437
38:20.000 --> 38:21.640
The suffering you cause others

438
38:21.720 --> 38:23.760
comes back to you.

439
38:26.840 --> 38:30.040
You two are evil. Both mother and daughter.

440
38:30.120 --> 38:33.200
If we're evil, then what do you call what you did?

441
38:35.040 --> 38:37.320
You wanted revenge on us,

442
38:37.400 --> 38:38.920
but you used Father as your weapon.

443
38:41.440 --> 38:43.480
Think about

444
38:43.560 --> 38:46.800
what would happen if he found out.

445
38:48.880 --> 38:51.000
Don't. Please.

446
38:53.240 --> 38:55.880
I don't want Father getting any more stressed.

447
38:56.920 --> 38:58.600
So stop this.

448
38:59.400 --> 39:00.760
Because if you don't,

449
39:01.680 --> 39:03.960
the people leaving this house

450
39:04.600 --> 39:06.000
won't be us.

451
39:06.840 --> 39:08.200
It'll be you.

452
39:10.760 --> 39:12.000
Let's go.

453
39:12.080 --> 39:13.280
Do you understand?

454
39:14.800 --> 39:15.960
Yes.

455
39:16.040 --> 39:18.240
I understood you from the first sentence.

456
39:19.560 --> 39:21.200
Let's go, madam.

457
39:25.880 --> 39:28.360
Madam, please sit.

458
39:28.440 --> 39:29.520
Too late.

459
39:31.120 --> 39:34.760
Madam, I can taste that smell.

460
39:42.480 --> 39:44.920
Thank you, Mom, for protecting me.

461
39:46.080 --> 39:47.960
You don't have to thank me.

462
39:48.040 --> 39:51.560
That's a mother's job. I should've done this long ago.

463
39:52.080 --> 39:54.880
I'm the one who should apologize to you

464
39:54.960 --> 39:56.960
for never being a good mother.

465
39:57.560 --> 40:00.960
Forget about the past, Mom. It's not too late to start over.

466
40:04.480 --> 40:08.200
I wonder when Grandpa will finally

467
40:08.280 --> 40:11.480
forgive me and soften toward me.

468
40:12.360 --> 40:15.320
There's only one way to win Grandpa over.

469
40:15.400 --> 40:19.000
Be sincere. You have to be patient.

470
40:20.560 --> 40:21.560
I will.

471
40:26.520 --> 40:27.800
Those roses are beautiful.

472
40:30.240 --> 40:33.440
Grandma Duangjai planted them herself.

473
40:39.040 --> 40:42.280
Grandma wanted to grow roses to brighten Grandpa's day.

474
40:42.360 --> 40:44.640
That way there would always be fragrant roses

475
40:45.280 --> 40:47.000
for his vase.

476
41:03.840 --> 41:05.040
Mom.

477
41:07.520 --> 41:09.040
From now on,

478
41:09.760 --> 41:12.400
I'll take care of this rose garden for you.

479
41:18.000 --> 41:19.640
And I'll take the best

480
41:20.480 --> 41:22.160
possible care of my daughter too.

481
41:26.880 --> 41:28.880
You don't have to worry about either of us.

482
41:47.120 --> 41:50.000
Now that Grandpa put you in charge of all construction sections,

483
41:50.080 --> 41:51.320
are you exhausted?

484
41:52.880 --> 41:56.280
I'll admit I'm tired, but I have more peace of mind.

485
41:57.600 --> 41:58.920
How so?

486
41:59.000 --> 42:00.720
Lots of work in the areas Pong supervised

487
42:00.800 --> 42:04.240
must be torn out and redone. But don't worry.

488
42:04.320 --> 42:05.480
We'll still finish on time.

489
42:06.080 --> 42:07.600
Thank you for helping.

490
42:15.000 --> 42:16.920
I brought lunch for everyone.

491
42:17.000 --> 42:19.520
Mom makes amazing rice noodles with spicy curry.

492
42:19.600 --> 42:21.280
I thought everyone might like it.

493
42:23.480 --> 42:25.880
Just smelling it is making me hungry.

494
42:29.040 --> 42:31.680
Everyone. Miss Hathaya

495
42:31.760 --> 42:34.400
is treating us to rice noodles for lunch today.

496
42:34.480 --> 42:37.280
Eat up, and then make sure we finish the work on schedule.

497
42:37.360 --> 42:40.320
-Yes, boss. Thank you. -Thank you.

498
42:43.480 --> 42:45.160
-You want some? -Yes.

499
42:46.200 --> 42:47.080
NUMBER 1 RAIWIN TRAIPONGRATCHATA

500
42:47.160 --> 42:49.240
You all live around here.

501
42:49.320 --> 42:50.960
Please support Raiwin.

502
42:51.560 --> 42:52.960
And

503
42:54.240 --> 42:57.640
-hand these out to customers. -Of course, Miss Chayanee.

504
42:57.720 --> 42:58.640
Let's go.

505
43:06.600 --> 43:07.640
Where did Raiwin go?

506
43:14.360 --> 43:15.800
Hello, beautiful vendor.

507
43:16.440 --> 43:19.160
I haven't eaten anything yet. Can I have some too?

508
43:20.680 --> 43:24.120
Let me get some curry for you.

509
43:39.920 --> 43:41.400
That looks delicious.

510
43:44.200 --> 43:45.400
Hathaya.

511
43:47.080 --> 43:49.160
Would you be one of my campaign canvassers?

512
43:51.280 --> 43:54.400
I'd rather not. Politics really isn't my thing.

513
43:55.160 --> 43:57.000
You're the perfect person for it.

514
43:57.520 --> 43:58.920
You're capable.

515
43:59.000 --> 44:01.360
Both the workers and people around here really like you.

516
44:02.400 --> 44:04.080
If you help campaign for me,

517
44:04.160 --> 44:07.520
I'm sure I'll win.

518
44:10.680 --> 44:13.640
Please. I'm asking you, Hathaya.

519
44:15.200 --> 44:16.320
What are you doing?

520
44:20.520 --> 44:23.160
I came to campaign among the workers.

521
44:23.760 --> 44:25.640
I was asking Hathaya to help canvass for me.

522
44:25.720 --> 44:28.040
You don't need Hathaya.

523
44:28.120 --> 44:29.520
She's an outsider.

524
44:31.560 --> 44:34.760
I was born here. I'm from here.

525
44:35.560 --> 44:37.000
My reputation is more than enough

526
44:37.080 --> 44:39.480
to get everyone to vote for you.

527
44:39.560 --> 44:42.200
You don't need to rely on anyone else.

528
44:42.720 --> 44:45.960
Besides, Hathaya comes from the lower class.

529
44:46.520 --> 44:48.000
You can't rely on people like that.

530
44:51.080 --> 44:52.680
Then why don't you

531
44:52.760 --> 44:54.880
help me campaign around here?

532
44:54.960 --> 44:57.680
You said you came to campaign among the workers, didn't you?

533
44:57.760 --> 45:00.080
Then go. Hand out your flyers.

534
45:01.920 --> 45:03.880
All right. Come with me.

535
45:07.000 --> 45:10.880
That curry looks good. I'm going to have some first.

536
45:10.960 --> 45:12.520
You go ahead.

537
45:14.760 --> 45:16.160
Go.

538
45:26.080 --> 45:27.080
Ramil.

539
45:28.880 --> 45:31.320
-Do me a favor. -What?

540
45:32.800 --> 45:35.760
Ask Hathaya to help campaign for me.

541
45:37.200 --> 45:39.560
I think you should ask Hathaya yourself.

542
45:40.440 --> 45:42.440
But she listens to you.

543
45:43.120 --> 45:44.640
Help me this once.

544
45:44.720 --> 45:46.920
Consider it repayment for the favor I did for you.

545
45:48.080 --> 45:50.200
I think

546
45:50.280 --> 45:53.640
Chayanee might have a problem with Hathaya helping you.

547
45:54.760 --> 45:56.720
Then don't let Chayanee know.

548
45:58.080 --> 46:00.440
I don't like her interfering in my business.

549
46:00.520 --> 46:02.960
Just talk to Hathaya for me.

550
46:09.120 --> 46:10.760
This curry is spicy,

551
46:10.840 --> 46:13.160
but apparently not spicy enough for you.

552
46:13.240 --> 46:15.000
So you're trying to get a taste of my man?

553
46:15.880 --> 46:18.080
Chaya, what are you talking about?

554
46:18.160 --> 46:20.120
If I'd arrived a little later,

555
46:20.200 --> 46:22.240
you two would've snuck off somewhere here.

556
46:22.320 --> 46:25.040
Chayanee. I've never thought about him that way.

557
46:25.120 --> 46:26.440
Never thought about it?

558
46:26.520 --> 46:28.360
Or you just never had the chance?

559
46:29.240 --> 46:30.960
You used to like Raiwin.

560
46:31.960 --> 46:33.560
Then you ended up with Ramil instead.

561
46:34.240 --> 46:36.960
What? That rough man

562
46:37.040 --> 46:40.160
doesn't satisfy you, so now you want another taste of my Raiwin?

563
46:42.360 --> 46:43.800
Hathaya,

564
46:45.000 --> 46:46.360
if you like things spicy,

565
46:46.440 --> 46:49.040
then I'll pour some curry on you to make it really burn.

566
46:51.760 --> 46:53.480
Stop thinking such disgusting things.

567
46:55.760 --> 46:57.560
I have never wanted another woman's man.

568
46:59.480 --> 47:01.800
Rather than wasting time being jealous,

569
47:01.880 --> 47:03.800
go take care of your own man.

570
47:05.760 --> 47:07.600
I spoke to Raiwin

571
47:07.680 --> 47:11.040
because I respect him as Ramil's older brother.

572
47:11.600 --> 47:12.640
And

573
47:13.160 --> 47:15.040
don't worry about me trying to steal him.

574
47:15.640 --> 47:18.000
I don't take another woman's man.

575
47:18.080 --> 47:19.280
I'm not like you.

576
47:19.360 --> 47:20.200
Hathaya.

577
47:20.280 --> 47:22.560
If you want to help Raiwin campaign,

578
47:22.640 --> 47:25.560
then behave properly. Act like the wealthy heiress you claim to be.

579
47:27.160 --> 47:30.240
Throwing tantrums and screaming in public isn't a good look.

580
47:33.080 --> 47:34.320
Raiwin.

581
47:37.640 --> 47:39.880
I called you. Didn't you hear me?

582
47:41.680 --> 47:42.520
Go.

583
47:51.760 --> 47:53.040
What is it?

584
48:13.840 --> 48:15.000
What was that?

585
48:16.000 --> 48:18.480
Did Chayanee say something that upset you?

586
48:19.520 --> 48:21.040
She's jealous of me.

587
48:22.200 --> 48:23.880
She thinks I'm stealing Raiwin.

588
48:31.960 --> 48:33.160
Why did you call me?

589
48:37.360 --> 48:38.720
What was that for?

590
48:41.240 --> 48:43.520
-Chayanee. -Don't raise your voice at me.

591
48:44.760 --> 48:46.320
I'm knocking some sense into you.

592
48:47.040 --> 48:48.800
If I call for you,

593
48:48.880 --> 48:50.520
you come to me immediately.

594
48:50.600 --> 48:52.920
Don't make me call you twice. You're embarrassing me.

595
48:53.000 --> 48:55.040
And you think I'm not embarrassed?

596
48:55.120 --> 48:57.800
You shouted my name like I was your servant.

597
48:57.880 --> 48:59.760
You're not my servant.

598
49:00.320 --> 49:03.320
But you belong to me. Not Hathaya.

599
49:09.760 --> 49:13.080
Chayanee is jealous of me. She thinks I'm stealing Raiwin.

600
49:13.160 --> 49:14.640
If I'd arrived a little later,

601
49:14.720 --> 49:16.280
you two would've snuck off somewhere.

602
49:16.360 --> 49:18.160
Ramil, you don't deserve this.

603
49:18.760 --> 49:20.800
I want you to get close to Hathai

604
49:20.880 --> 49:23.160
and lure her into your trap.

605
49:23.240 --> 49:24.160
NEXT EPISODE

606
49:24.240 --> 49:25.160
You know

607
49:25.240 --> 49:28.000
I'm good at getting close to women.

608
49:28.080 --> 49:30.480
Raiwin asked me to talk to you.

609
49:30.560 --> 49:32.120
He wants you to help campaign for him.

610
49:32.200 --> 49:33.080
Mr. Saksit,

611
49:33.160 --> 49:34.920
do you even realize what you're doing?

612
49:35.520 --> 49:37.400
You're hurting your own son.

613
51:29.520 --> 51:33.680
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
